didn't fix it.  Trying all the reset functions I could find in
SRM didn't fix it.

BTW, NetBSD does see the RealTek 8169S, but will not boot if
it is configured:
http://mail-index.netbsd.org/netbsd-help/2005/06/13/0011.html


