Nope, net.inet.ip.forwarding = 1, thus IP forwarding is on. Since I wrote 
the mail I've found out that the problem lies in the tun interface which 
doesn't work as it's supposed to. After recompiling the kernel with tap 
instead everything works.

Cheers,
Anders

